Patients - Search is open by default
Shows a big text box 'Search' and a 'Search' button at the far right and 'Advanced Search' next to it.
Advanced Search expands a section below the searchbox including Name(text), Phone(text), Email (text), Last Modified Between (2 dates, or range selection), All Teams (checkbox)
Results appear in a table showing Name, Phone, Last Modified Date, Last Action (Or N/A if none), Owning Team. Name is clickable

