Patients - New Patient
Opens the patient page.
breadcrumb: Home > Patients > <PatientName>
Left menu: 
Personal Info (Enabled)
Medical Info (Disabled with lock icon)
Family (Disabled with lock icon)
Allergies (Disabled with lock icon)
Vitals (Disabled with lock icon)
Immunization (Disabled with lock icon)
Medications (Disabled with lock icon)
Problems (Disabled with lock icon)
Lab Results (Disabled with lock icon)
History (Disabled with lock icon)

Buttons: 'Continue', 'Save and Close', and 'Cancel' buttons.
	Once Continue button is clicked, patient is saved and we're taken to Edit Patient mode, alert appears at the top that patient created successfully. Hides in 5 seconds
	Once Save and Close is clicked, patient is saved and we go back to search page - alert appears at the top of the search page that patient created successfully. Hides in 5 seconds
	Once Cancel is clicked, we go back to Search page - Are you sure appears first
	
Patient in Edit Mode
All left menu items are enabled
Save button in every tab that contains data (not tabs that contain tables)
Add Item in every tab that contains table which opens a popup to add an item. and Save on the popup itself. A delete button infrot of each row. Main field in row is clickable and opens same popup in edit mode and an update button. when popup closes, refresh the table
History tab is different. It shows a timeline and 3 buttons at the top: Add diagnosis, tratment, followup
Each item in the timeline is clickable and opens its item in a popup. with modify button. Add buttons opens separate page for every type

